x-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;overflow-wrap:break-word;padding-top:24px;padding-bottom:32px;}</style><div class="css-1ybfxxc"><style data-emotion-css="1ii68zy">.css-1ii68zy{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;display:-webkit-box;display:-webkit-flex;display:-ms-flexbox;display:flex;-webkit-flex-direction:column;-ms-flex-direction:column;flex-direction:column;font-weight:400;}.css-1ii68zy img{width:100%;}.css-1ii68zy iframe{margin:auto;}.css-1ii68zy figcaption{text-align:center;font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin-top:-16px;margin-bottom:24px;color:#76808F;}@media screen and (min-width:767px){.css-1ii68zy figcaption{font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin-top:-12px;margin-bottom:32px;}}@media screen and (min-width:1023px){.css-1ii68zy figcaption{font-size:12px;line-height:24px;margin-top:-12px;margin-bottom:32px;}}</style><article class="css-1ii68zy"><style data-emotion-css="3fpgoh">.css-3fpgoh{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;font-size:14px;line-height:28px;margin-bottom:16px;color:#1E2026;}@media screen and (min-width:767px){.css-3fpgoh{font-size:16px;line-height:28px;margin-bottom:24px;}}@media screen and (min-width:1023px){.css-3fpgoh{font-size:16px;line-height:28px;margin-bottom:24px;}}</style><div class="css-3fpgoh"><style data-emotion-css="1lohbqv">.css-1lohbqv{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;font-weight:600;}</style><strong class="css-1lohbqv">What is Delisting</strong></div><div class="css-3fpgoh">Delisting is the removal of a listed asset from an exchange. The delisting can be voluntary or involuntary and usually results when a project ceases operations, does not meet listing requirements, undergo a hard fork, split or reverse split occasions with new coins. There are numerous factors that could go into the decision for an exchange to delist an asset. </div><div class="css-3fpgoh"></div><div class="css-3fpgoh"><strong class="css-1lohbqv">What to Expect During Delisting</strong><br class="css-vurnku"/>When an asset gets delisted from an exchange, all of its trading pairs will stop trading and be removed. An official announcement will be released prior to the cessation of the trading date to acknowledge all users. Users are still able to trade until the cessation of the trading date. </div><div class="css-3fpgoh">During the last hour on the cessation of trading date, the mark price of the delisted asset will be calculated as the average of the price index every second over the last hour before cessation, i.e. total 3600 mark price. </div><div class="css-3fpgoh">It is important to note that users are not allowed to open positions of the delisted asset and are only allowed to close the position i.e. placing reduce-only orders 10 minutes before the cessation of trading. </div><div class="css-3fpgoh">If users choose to hold the position until the cessation of trading, the position will be automatically closed or settled. Please be noted trading fees will be charged for the automatic settlement. All unrealized P/L is calculated at the time of settlement and converted into realized P/L. </div><div class="css-3fpgoh">Traders are advised to close any open positions of the delisted asset before the cessation of trading to avoid automatic settlement of position.</div></article></div></div><style data-emotion-css="4onxi8">.css-4onxi8{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;display:none;overflow:hidden;padding-right:16px;margin-bottom:0;width:30%;}@media screen and (min-width:767px){.css-4onxi8{display:block;padding-right:24px;}}@media screen and (min-width:1023px){.css-4onxi8{display:block;padding-right:17%;}}@media screen and (min-width:767px){.css-4onxi8{margin-bottom:40px;}}@media screen and (min-width:1023px){.css-4onxi8{margin-bottom:64px;}}</style><div class="css-4onxi8"><style data-emotion-css="1bn8vkt">.css-1bn8vkt{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;min-width:0;display:-webkit-inline-box;display:-webkit-inline-flex;display:-ms-inline-flexbox;display:inline-flex;position:relative;heigh